                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Initially I was skeptical to play because of the first review I read (it had talked about there being this bug), but after watching the video and seeing the patch update, I realized that the other reviewer just did that for youtube views haha- anyway the game itself is alright.  Surprisingly the style and the mechanics of the game were on point- I love the color palette but I think the character design is a litle weak. Either way, I recommend this game for anyone! The puzzles and the thinking that goes into it is a little challenging but worth it. i'd definitely give it a try!",
